      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They've stated before on stream that storage is cheap, but the UI isn't equipped to handle more prints. I'm constantly trashing memories from my friends and groups to make room. Yes, the files are stored on my computer. But the print metadata that allows people in-game to see info, including the world, is lost forever.\n\nMeanwhile, I'm watching item after item after item after item be released and somehow they have UI that can handle that, as well as unlimited avatar accessory looks.\n\nDon't forget to claim your 350 VRChat credits that forces you to look at the shop to claim and realize you don't have enough credits to buy an item. This is our VRC+ *exclusive* bonus this month, rather than an item.\n\nVRC+ supporters are getting the short end of the stick and I'm here to say no, I would not be willing to pay an additional subscription for more than a handful of sticker and print slots. Don't normalize less for more.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-07-06T18:35:01.930Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "NUMEROUS people I have talked to would gladly add more money onto their subscription as DLC to VRC+ to get more sticker, print and emoji slots in order to bring more of their art onto the platform. This would both be a good monetization path allowing for the price to prop up the extra space, while giving people the opportunity to not get the extra cost if they arent going to use the extra slots",
